              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಗಲಭೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ತುಂಬಾ ಹಿಂಸೆ ನಡೆಯಿತು. galabheyalli tumbā hiṃse naḍeyitu. There was a lot of violence in the riot."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹಿಂಸೆ (hiṃse) ಕೊಡು is to torment; ಅಹಿಂಸೆ is non-violence."
            }
          ]
        },
